#question(title: [Convergence and divergence])[
  Let $display({a_n}_(n = 0)^oo)$ be a
  sequence.  \
  Write the formal definition of the
  following concepts:

  #set enum(spacing: .55em + 0.85cm)
  + $display({a_n}_(n = 0)^oo)$ is
    convergent.
  + $display({a_n}_(n = 0)^oo)$ is
    divergent.
  + $display({a_n}_(n = 0)^oo)$ is divergent
    to $oo$.

  #v(1fr)
]
